<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage 10.45 bln rand Mon.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage 10.45 bln rand Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose slightly to 10.446 billion rand on Monday from 10.403 billion rand on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
